  "description": "Google Analytics 4 inside the Umbraco backoffice. Adds an \"Analytics\"\n      section with Realtime, Visitors, Behaviour, Acquisition and Technology\n      dashboards, and an \"Analytics\" tab on every document showing that page's\n      traffic, referrers, previous/next pages, locations and devices — all read\n      live from your GA4 property through the Google Analytics Data API. Editors\n      get the numbers where they work, without a Google login. Optional Google\n      PageSpeed Insights and Search Console tabs come with the shared\n      Flowcourier.Umbraco.Analytics.Core package. Configured from appsettings\n      (property id + a service-account key shared with Search Console); no\n      database schema; no Google SDK; the key never leaves the server.\n      Successor to the legacy Flowcourier.Umbraco.Analytics package.",
